  "ingredients": [
    "10 ounce bacon",
    "4 large egg",
    "2 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "4 cup spinach",
    "1/4 teaspoon all-purpose seasoning (such as Mrs. Dash)",
    "1/4 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1/4 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1/2 cup cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400F. Create the bacon weave and place in the oven for 25 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01314.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "After it's been cooking for about 15 minutes, we can get started on the eggs.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack the eggs into a container. Add in the heavy cream (half a tablespoon per egg).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01319.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01322.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait until the bacon weave is cooked. It should look pretty brown by the time it's finished.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01324.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the bacon weave to a paper towel to cool and drain off any excess grease, making it crisper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01326.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create a funnel using the piece of foil used to cook the bacon. We'll be using some of this bacon grease to cook the eggs and spinach.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01329.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the bacon grease into a pan over medium-high heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01331.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach to the bacon grease and stir. Allow the spinach to cook and then turn the heat down to medium-low. Add the eggs and seasoning and do not touch them.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01339.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the eggs have cooked on the bottom, mix them up. They should be a bit moist rather than overcooked and rubbery.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay the eggs on top of the bacon weave. Try to place them as evenly over the bacon weave as possible, leaving a slight overlay of the bacon at the bottom. Add the cheese on top once the eggs are properly set.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01342.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the bacon weave to a foil-lined baking sheet. Set the oven to broil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01343.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil the bacon weave and eggs for about 3 minutes under the highest or second-highest setting.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01345.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into slices.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/DSC01347.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-breakfast-stax/#wprm-recipe-50741-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
